### Test A — Classification agent
```bash
curl -s -X POST http://localhost:8010/api/ticket-classification/classify \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "ticket_id": "TEST-CLS-1",
    "title": "Commercial auto premiums too low",
    "description": "Underwriters say commercial auto premium quotes are coming in 12-15% lower than expected since last weeks rating config change. Personal auto is fine.",
    "priority": "P2",
    "status": "Open"
  }' | python3 -m json.tool
```
**Expected output (check each field):**
